 .../boot/dts/apple/t6050-peripherals.dtsi     |  22 +-
 3 files changed, 390 insertions(+), 350 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-gpu-g17c.dtsi

